    "title": "Hosted Local workspaces get their own filesystem boundary",
    "intro": "A focused server-side fix reshapes how Aura handles workspace paths when a Local harness is running in a hosted environment, preventing the server from leaking its own lookalike paths into agent sessions and API responses. The nightly desktop builds ship across macOS, Windows, and Linux on top of this change.",
    "entries": [
      {
        "batch_id": "entry-1",
        "time_label": "4:22 AM",
        "started_at": "2026-07-16T11:22:07.000Z",
        "ended_at": "2026-07-16T11:22:07.000Z",
        "title": "Isolation for hosted Local harness workspaces",
        "summary": "The server now recognizes when a Local harness is running in a hosted runtime and stops exposing its own filesystem paths to agents and clients, deferring to the hosted harness as the source of truth.",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Agent chat sessions no longer inject a workspace index block built from server-side paths when a hosted Local runtime is available, avoiding prompts that reference filesystems the agent can't actually read.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "972384031274810f17ce8888d05b3bf06bfaea83"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "text": "Instance API responses now omit `workspace_path` for hosted Local harnesses, so browser callers can't accidentally echo an unusable server path back to the harness; runtime entry points resolve the authoritative path by project UUID instead.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "972384031274810f17ce8888d05b3bf06bfaea83"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "text": "Workspace path resolution was unified around `resolve_project_tool_workspace_path` with proper error propagation through the agent and instance chat routes, replacing the older instance-specific helper.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "972384031274810f17ce8888d05b3bf06bfaea83"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "text": "Added a Render deployment guide covering the hosted local runtime configuration this change depends on.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "972384031274810f17ce8888d05b3bf06bfaea83"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
